{"id":"en_the-light-he-can-never-reach","title":"The Light He Can Never Reach","titleEn":"The Light He Can Never Reach","description":"For three years, Jade hoped for a child, and when she finally conceives, her husband Hudson shatters the moment by moving in Amara, the sweetheart from his past, along with Amara's daughter. He hands over the nursery Jade prepared and expects her to accept it graciously. Unable to bear the betrayal, Jade walks away, carrying her unborn baby and a gift she had kept hidden: the restoration of ancient manuscripts. That skill lifts her into the upper ranks of her field. When she steps before the press at her debut, Hudson appears to demand she come home, only for an enigmatic billionaire to seize the microphone, declare Jade his wife, and state plainly that she is not going back.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-light-he-can-never-reach/en_US/b468ba67b12b9746/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-light-he-can-never-reach/en_US/b468ba67b12b9746/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Betrayal/Cheating","Billionaire","Contemporary","Female","Regret","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlkka/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-light-he-can-never-reach_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlkka/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-light-he-can-never-reach_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlkka/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-light-he-can-never-reach_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlkka/?pub=4occak","kind":"em